{
  "description": "Charlotte Plains is a family-owned working sheep station and campground near Cunnamulla, Queensland. Visitors can soak in the naturally heated, mineral-rich Artesian Hot Springs while taking in stunning outback views. Beyond the springs, the property offers an authentic station experience with self-drive audio tours, abundant wildlife, and rich birdlife surrounding the campgrounds.",
